    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\n'25 Arduain' is a spacious, elegant, and modern 4-bedroomed home within walking distance of Enniscorthy town with an array of shops, restaurants, cafe's, excellent amenities, schools, and public transport to hand. \n\nThe fine home boasts many features with include modern bright well-appointed rooms, stylist tiling, wooden flooring, outstanding location within this prestigious development, it's completely private with green area to front and the spacious rear garden has mature trees behind. Its stands 108.3 at sq. m (approx.) and offers generous accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway, large kitchen/dining room, sitting room with light filled window and feature open fireplace, utility, guest WC. Accommodation on the first floor consists of four bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nThe property captures a wonderful sense of space and light throughout. There is an excellent balance of well proportioned and tastefully detailed rooms which enjoy a high specification and excellent quality features throughout. \n\nThis dwelling is guaranteed to appeal particularly to families seeking a home of quality in a nice neighbourhood or perhaps those seeking an attractive residential investment opportunity in a location second to none and only minutes walk to the town centre. \n\nIncluded in the sale:Carpets, curtains, blinds, light fittings, sliding wardrobes in bedroom, fridge, dishwasher, cooker, hob and extractor fan.\n\nView and be impressed!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance: - 1.9m x 4.0m\nWill wooden flooring with great unstairs storage.\n\nLiving Room: - 3.3m x 4.4m\nLovely side room with views to front garden, wooden flooring and open fireplace.\n\nKitchen: - 2.8m x 3.5m\nSpacious family room with fitted kitchen with dining area off., cooker, fridge & dishwasher included.\n\nDining Area: - 2.5m x 3.5m\nSpaciousee dining area with wooden flooring.\n\nUtility Room: - 3.0m x 2.6m\nPlumbed for washing machine and offering a great storage area.\n\nW.C.: - 3.0m x 0.9m\nWith wc & whb\n\nLanding: - 2.7m x 5.5m\nWith quality carpet to floor.\n\nMaster Bedroom: - 2.7m x 4.3m\nLovely double room with quality carpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 2: - 2.5m x 4.0m\nDouble room with quality carpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 3: - 3.0m x 3.6m\nDouble room with quality carpet to floor.\n\nBedroom 4: - 2.5m x 2.4m\nideal as a singe room or home office, with quality carpet to floor.\n\nShower Room - 1.7m x 2.3m\nModern with shower, wc and wh.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious 4 bedroomed home c. 108sqs mts.</li><li>Superb location within walking distance of Enniscorthy town centre. </li><li>Walk in Condition and ready for immediate occupation.</li><li> Not over-looked with large private rear garden and facing a green area.</li><li>Small quiet development. </li><li>Recent improvements include preplacement of front and back doors, heating boiler and wooden flooring.</li><li>Built in 1998.</li><li>Services: </li><li>Main's water and sewage.</li><li>Oil fired central heating.</li><li>Fiber broadband available in the house.</li><li></li><li> Includes in the sale </li><li>Carpets, curtains, blinds, light fittings, slidewrobes in bedroom, fridge, dishwasher, cooker, hob and extractor fan.</ul>"
      },
